	(text "SWD is direct; damping depends on probe/cable edges and layout.\nDS13313 does not prescribe a universal 22R or 55R series resistor.\nNRST has an internal 30-50k pull-up; C20 = 100nF (DS13313 NRST data).\nU3 clamp rail is +3V3: validate rail injection and power-off behavior.\nUSBLC6-2 DS4260 pinout/topology; short return path required."
		(at 199.39 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3083236b-03db-45f9-bfcd-0c07ebe67e21")
	)
	(text "USB LAYOUT: keep DP/DM coupled over an uninterrupted ground reference.\nJoin duplicate Type-C data contacts at J2; U3 close to connector.\nFinal impedance/skew depend on stackup and PHY timing, not series R alone.\nDS4260 Figures 6/17: minimize ESD path inductance. Routed 90R pair over In1 GND."
		(at 105.41 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3c1f8674-cc10-447f-a9a6-a9b4e188efa7")
	)
	(text "USB LOAD: F1 PTC Ihold = 0.75 A at 20-23C, 0.55 A at 50C.\nActual concurrent worst-case board/external current is not established.\nRestricted bench use until host current, startup and thermal budget are checked.\nF1 does not negotiate USB current; replacing it alone cannot approve more load."
		(at 60.96 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "576d4cc2-c6b3-45e7-a79d-9c7ae4adb35b")
	)
	(text "USB-C J2: TVS, FUSE, CC RESISTORS, ESD"
		(at 60.96 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5cabd68c-3fcf-4dfd-a283-05b4c8cf62ec")
	)
	(text "SWD: J3 STDC14, J19 TAG-CONNECT; RESET AND BOOT BUTTONS"
		(at 191.77 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4ad51b42-ceb6-46da-b2f9-805ba01f2c1c")
	)
